---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Consulting & Contact"
  description="Book a 30-minute consultation on single-tenant LLM deployment, vendor selection, or AI delivery for regulated industries."
>
  <section class="border-b border-[var(--color-rule)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Consulting</p>
      <h1 class="m-0 mb-6" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);">
        Get a second opinion.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg max-w-2xl mb-8" style="color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
        I help compliance-heavy buyers (financial services, healthcare,
        defence, public sector) get from "we should look at single-tenant
        LLMs" to "we've shipped one in production" without the usual months
        of vendor tyre-kicking.
      </p>

      <div class="rule-double my-8">
        <h2 class="mt-0 mb-3 pt-0 border-none">What a 30-minute call covers</h2>
        <ul class="m-0 list-none p-0 space-y-3">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono" style="color: var(--color-accent);">01</span>
            <span>Your specific compliance perimeter: what data, what regulations, what residency.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono" style="color: var(--color-accent);">02</span>
            <span>Workload profile: token volume, latency requirements, peak-vs-steady, model size.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono" style="color: var(--color-accent);">03</span>
            <span>Realistic shortlist: typically two or three vendors, with the trade-offs spelled out for your buyer.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono" style="color: var(--color-accent);">04</span>
            <span>Common pitfalls: the procurement, security, and architecture traps that catch first-time single-tenant deployers.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2>Engagement options</h2>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8">
        <div class="border border-[var(--color-rule)] p-6">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Free</p>
          <h3 class="mt-0 mb-3" style="font-size: 1.25rem;">Discovery call</h3>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
            30 minutes. No pitch, no slides. We talk about your situation,
            and you walk away with a recommendation either way.
          </p>
          <a href="mailto:simon@singletenant.ai?subject=Discovery%20call" class="btn-primary">Email me</a>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-[var(--color-accent)] p-6"
             style="background: var(--color-accent-soft);">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-2" style="color: var(--color-accent);">Paid</p>
          <h3 class="mt-0 mb-3" style="font-size: 1.25rem;">Vendor selection</h3>
          <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
            Two-week engagement. Requirements doc, vendor shortlist with
            trade-off analysis, RFP support, and a recommended path to
            POC. Fixed fee.
          </p>
          <a href="mailto:simon@singletenant.ai?subject=Vendor%20selection%20engagement" class="btn-primary">Get a quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Who I work with</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Mid-market enterprises with a defined compliance profile. UK and EU
          primarily; selectively US. Most engagements are with engineering
          leaders, heads of platform, or director-of-AI roles, sometimes paired
          with internal procurement or compliance.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm <strong>SC clearance eligible</strong> for UK government work and
          have previously held responsibilities under classified environments.
        </p>

        <h3>Other ways to reach me</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:simon@singletenant.ai">simon@singletenant.ai</a></li>
          <li>LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/newton-simon/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/newton-simon</a></li>
          <li>Vendor partnership enquiries: same inbox, please mention vendor name in subject</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
